2 node_t *n = malloc(sizeof(node_t)); 3 assert(n ! = NULL); 4 n->value = value; 5 n->next = head; 6 head = n;
This code performs a simple insertion, but if called by multiple threads at the “same time”, has a race condition (see if you can ﬁgure out why).
